WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:33.547
Kip climbed down the tree.

2
00:00:33.548 --> 00:00:38.285
"Bird is my best friend," said Kip.

3
00:00:38.286 --> 00:00:44.414
"But she is keeping secrets from me."

4
00:00:44.415 --> 00:00:49.398
A cold wind blew.

5
00:00:49.399 --> 00:00:54.375
Kip shivered.

6
00:00:54.376 --> 00:00:59.909
"I'm angry at Bird," he said.

7
00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:07.303
"I'm going to find a new friend!"

8
00:01:07.304 --> 00:01:14.497
Squirrel was waiting to cross the bike path.

9
00:01:14.498 --> 00:01:20.539
"Squirrel and I both gather acorns," said Kip.

10
00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:30.072
"I'll be friends with Squirrel."

11
00:01:30.073 --> 00:01:33.217
"Hi, Squirrel," said Kip.

12
00:01:33.218 --> 00:01:37.040
"Do you want to gather acorns together?"

13
00:01:37.041 --> 00:01:40.095
"No thanks," said Squirrel.

14
00:01:40.096 --> 00:01:56.116
"I have enough acorns."

15
00:01:56.117 --> 00:01:59.086
Frog was jumping to the pond.

16
00:01:59.087 --> 00:02:03.860
"I like to jump too," said Kip.

17
00:02:03.861 --> 00:02:07.212
"I'll be friends with Frog."

18
00:02:07.213 --> 00:02:10.006
"Hi, Frog," said Kip.

19
00:02:10.007 --> 00:02:17.498
"Do you want to jump around with me?"

20
00:02:17.499 --> 00:02:21.927
"Maybe in the spring," said Frog.

21
00:02:21.928 --> 00:02:31.529
"I'm going to sleep for the winter."

22
00:02:31.530 --> 00:02:37.348
"This is terrible," cried Kip.

23
00:02:37.349 --> 00:02:41.866
"Bird is keeping secrets from me.

24
00:02:41.867 --> 00:02:52.268
And I can't find a new friend!"
